eb.hint.defer_shape=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fThe box outline while you aim is §eDefer Shape Calculation§f - it holds off working out the full shape until you stop moving, which keeps the game smooth. Hold still for a moment to see the real shape, and placing always builds it exactly. §7Prefer the live preview? Turn it off in §eSettings §8> §ePlayer Settings§7.
