eb.hint.panel.settings=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fTap a setting to change it; the tip at the bottom explains it. §eQuick Setup§f sets everything for your device in one tap.
eb.hint.panel.clipboard=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fThe Clipboard Manager stores multiple copy/cut selections so you can paste any of them later.

