eb.hint.mode.line=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fLine: first click sets the start, second click sets the end.
eb.hint.mode.wall=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fWall: first click sets one corner, second click sets the height and width.
eb.hint.mode.floor=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fFloor: first click sets one corner, second click sets the opposite corner.
eb.hint.mode.diagonal_line=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fDiagonal Line: like Line, but follows any angle - first click start, second click end.
eb.hint.mode.diagonal_wall=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fDiagonal Wall: first click sets the base line, second click sets the height.
eb.hint.mode.slope_floor=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fSlope Floor: first click sets the low corner, second click sets the high corner.
eb.hint.mode.cube=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fCube: first click sets one corner, second click sets the opposite corner.
eb.hint.mode.circle=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fCircle: first click sets the center, second click sets the radius.
eb.hint.mode.cylinder=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fCylinder: first click sets the center, second click sets the radius, third click sets the height.
eb.hint.mode.sphere=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fSphere: first click sets the center, second click sets the radius.
eb.hint.mode.semicircle=§a[EB] §r§7Tip: §fSemicircle: first click sets the center, second click sets the radius.
